				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;searchresult&#34;&gt;SearchResult&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#searchresult&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A result returned from global workspace search.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-graphql&#34; data-lang=&#34;graphql&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;union&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;SearchResult&lt;/span&gt; = Folder | Project | User&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;possible-types&#34;&gt;Possible types&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#possible-types&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;searchresultfolder-object&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/folder&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity-parent&#34;&gt;SearchResult&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;code class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity-name&#34;&gt;Folder&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#searchresultfolder-object&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A virtual folder used to organize workspace resources.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;searchresultproject-object&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/project&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity-parent&#34;&gt;SearchResult&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;code class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity-name&#34;&gt;Project&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#searchresultproject-object&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A unit of work tracked in the workspace.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;searchresultuser-object&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/user&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity-parent&#34;&gt;SearchResult&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;code class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-entity-name&#34;&gt;User&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#searchresultuser-object&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A workspace member who owns and collaborates on projects.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;returned-by&#34;&gt;Returned By&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#returned-by&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/operations/queries/search&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;search&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
